WEBVTT

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
ashita he tsuzuku sakamichi no tochuu de

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
On the uphill road that leads to tomorrow

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
surechigau otona tachi wa tsubuyaku no sa

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
We pass by adults who tell us this

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"ai toka yume toka risou mo wakaru kedo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"I can understand ideals such as love and dreams

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
me no mae no genjitsu wa sonna ni amaku nai" tte

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
but the real world isn't as easy as you think"

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
tsumazuki nagara mo korogari nagara mo

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
Even though we keep tripping and falling

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
kasabuta darake no jyounetsu wo wasuretaku nai

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
We have to remember these pains of growing up

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
otona ni narenai bokura no

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
For all of us who can't force ourselves to do so yet

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
tsuyogari wo hitotsu kiite kure

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Listen to this one thing I have to say

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
nige mo kakure mo shinai kara

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
I won't run or cower away

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
waraitai yatsu dake warae

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
So whoever wants to laugh at me, go ahead

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
semete tayori nai bokura no

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
Since we can't be relied upon yet

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
jiyuu no me wo tsumitoranai de

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Don't take away our seed of freedom

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
mizu wo ageru sono yakume wo

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
The task of nurturing this plant

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
hataseba iindarou?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
That's all we have to do, right?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.020
{Intro}

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.200
We are almost there, Mister Eagle.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.080
When the sun rises, we'll have
breakfast, so do your best.

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.370
It's close...

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:48.040
That's the city, isn't it?

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.340
Okay! Keep going straight
in this direction.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:52.880
{Part A}

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.350
The Lightning Boy from the Demon World

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:04.520
Time for you to get up, Kiyomaro!

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.850
Hurry up and get out of bed,
so you can eat breakfast!

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:10.230
Are you listening to me, Kiyomaro?

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:13.570
Are you planning to skip school again?

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:15.740
What is there for me to study

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.740
in junior high right now?

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:20.820
You're probably being bullied
because you think that way!

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:24.450
Try to at least make one friend,
if you're so ashamed!

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:25.910
Shut up!

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.620
Why do I have to become
friends with that inferior bunch?

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.750
Hey!

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:36.720
"Shut up" is the first thing you
don't say to your mother!

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.930
Looks like I'm tired...
I'll just pretend I didn't see that.

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.560
Don't ignore me!

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:53.770
You're Takamine Seitarou's son,
Takamine Kiyomaro, right?

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.400
W-Who the hell are you, suddenly
barging into my room like that?

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:59.700
Your father entrusted you to me.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.820
My name is Gash Bell.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.780
This letter is for you.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:11.500
Kiyomaro, congratulations
on your 14th birthday.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.630
Now I know this is kind of sudden, but...

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.380
The boy who delivered this
letter is named Gash Bell.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:19.800
I saved him from dying
in a forest in England.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.600
Then he told me he would
like to return the favor.

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.890
I have a son named Kiyomaro.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:34.440
It seems he's become a fool recently. He thinks
he's smart and doesn't have to go to school.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:38.610
Gash...
Will you please discipline him?

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:40.950
I got it!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:44.490
For what my life is worth, I'll help him!

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.830
Thank you.

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:49.830
Even if he is a little different,
he is a very good boy.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.330
But I felt sorry that he
lost most of his memories.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:58.460
The red book he has with him
is the only hint to his past.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:02.180
But even an archaeologist like myself
was unable to interpret it.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:04.930
With your intelligence,
you might be able to do it.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:10.770
"Please work out the clues,
and help him get back to his homeland."

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.350
So that's how it is!

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.320
From now on, I will be in charge
of your training, Kiyomaro!

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:18.650
Please take good care of me.

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:23.240
Why do I have to be trained...

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.660
...by a little brat like you?

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.030
Stop kidding me!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.580
Lightning?

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.170
W-What are you?

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.630
Gash Bell, like I said.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.510
Why is this room burnt black?

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:45.890
What?

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.510
You're asking me to take care
of him if I stay home?

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.770
Of course!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.430
Gash-chan came to be your trainer.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.890
You gotta be kidding me!

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:57.860
This guy shoots lightning
out of his m-mouth!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.070
There's no way he can do that.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:01.820
Right, Gash-chan?

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.860
Yeah, there is no way lightning can
come out from someone's mouth.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.410
He's playing the fool.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:08.830
Okay then.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.330
I'll just go to school.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.540
Isn't that what you're
supposed to be doing?

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:17.710
A red book, eh?

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:22.170
- I'm borrowing this.
- Hey, Kiyomaro! Give that back!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.380
Kiyomaro!

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.800
I'm sorry, Gash-chan.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:32.180
He has no friends because
he's always been like that.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:37.690
Does Mother-dono want
Kiyomaro to make friends?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.150
Yeah...

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:41.610
Do not worry!

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.360
I will make friends for Kiyomaro!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:48.780
Therefore, Mother-dono, please cheer up!

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:51.780
Thank you.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.250
You must become his
friend as well, okay?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.080
I will be friend #1!

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.130
So this is Kiyomaro's school.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.850
What's with this red book?

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.810
I've never seen these kinds
of characters before.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.850
And there's no prescribed grammar.

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:21.480
"The first spell... Zakeru."

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:21.480
Note: Zakeru is a spell to trigger Gash's first attack!

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:25.570
Why? Why can I only understand the
text written in a different color?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.200
Takamine.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.450
Yes?

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.410
Try solving this question.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.580
-5x^2 y^6

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:34.830
That's correct.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.250
You may sit.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.830
Aren't you doing well, Kiyomaro?

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:44.590
Just a basic question.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.800
What's with that guy?

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.970
I was just thinking about
how he finally showed up.

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.260
I'm disgusted.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:51.640
If you don't need to study,
just go home!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.310
He wants to feel a sense
of superiority that badly?

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.810
What's the reason for my existence?

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.570
What's the matter, Kiyomaro?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:10.200
Are you going home already?

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:11.780
Kiyomaro!

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.620
Ah, Takamine-kun.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.660
Are you going home already?

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.710
It's still only lunch break.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.210
It's been a while since you came,
so why don't you stay until class finishes?

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:25.460
Is that you, Mizuno?

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.720
If class is boring, then please
help me with my studies again.

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.970
Enough already!
Mind your own business!

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.800
I'm already fed up with school!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:37.220
But, when you taught me mathematics,

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:41.230
it was really easy to understand,
even to an idiot like me.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.690
Takamine-kun really is a genius.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.520
Sh...Shut up!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.110
Anyway, I'm going home!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.280
Ah, Takamine-kun...

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:49.900
You fool!

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.200
She's saying those things for your sake!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.280
Why the hell are you going back home?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.290
Oh dear, are you Takamine-kun's friend?

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.660
My name is Gash Bell.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.580
Well, pleased to meet you,

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:04.790
Gatsu-kun.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:06.960
It's "Gash".

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:09.260
You! What are you doing?

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.760
Well... umm...
I came to help you.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.930
Don't come to
school as you please!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.090
What's up?

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.180
A kid came inside.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.390
Who is that?

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.430
Isn't that great, Kiyomaro?

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:24.150
There is a girl who cares about you.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.310
- Don't play around with me.
- All right, Kiyomaro!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.360
Let's execute the "Ally of Justice" plan!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.240
Ally of Justice plan

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:35.450
In school, there are these people
called "delinquents," right?

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:37.530
Kiyomaro can beat down
these delinquents,

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.200
and save the students in trouble!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.620
Why must I do that? Don't
decide this on your own!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:44.960
I see...

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.590
Then, let's kneel down and beg
them to be your friend!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:53.220
That's even worse!

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.470
Gash, let me tell you something...

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.510
After School

00:09:00.520 --> 00:09:02.060
This is the place, Kiyomaro?

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.060
That's right.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:07.650
If you go up these stairs, there's a gathering
place for delinquents called the "rooftop."

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.230
When the delinquents
pick on me up there...

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.900
Then I will come to the rescue.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:12.940
All right!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.990
Carrying out the "Ally of Justice" plan!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.410
Finally got rid of the nuisance.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:27.670
Who cares whether he's returning a
favor or whatever, it's disturbing me.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.170
Where is the big delinquent?

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.380
Come out!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.050
Strange...

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.260
There is no...

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:39.300
- Oh?
- Huh?

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.850
You're that girl!

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:43.220
Ah, Takamine-kun's friend.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:46.270
My name is Suzume,
Mizuno Suzume.

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.940
I see, Miss Suzume-dono, eh?

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:50.110
Nice to meet you, Gocha-kun.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.440
It's "Gash"!

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.900
Don't tell me Suzume-dono
is the delinquent?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:01.120
Don't say such strange things.
A "delinquent" is...

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.870
Someone who hurts other people,

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.830
bullies the weak,

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.460
robs their money,

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:11.340
and has a mean look in his
eyes, head, and face...

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.380
Like him, right?

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.680
Yo, Mizuno.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:19.840
Whose face looks mean?

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.140
Yours!

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:26.430
A delinquent like you will be finished
off by Kiyomaro, the Ally of Justice.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:29.310
Being finished off by
Kiyomaro is your fate...

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.980
You are saying some
interesting things, brat.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.570
Why don't you show me...

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.530
Gash-kun!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:43.830
...whether he's really coming or not.

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.660
What a cute girl.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.080
That girl's panties are definitely white!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.630
All right, I've decided!

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.460
I'll make her my girlfriend!

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:55.460
Eita.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:57.800
Looking at girls' asses again?

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.970
Wouldn't it be nice to fly all
the way over to that rooftop?

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.970
What's the matter, Haido?

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:10.140
I found a small one.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.110
Well then, let's go, Eita.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:16.820
Jikeru!

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:19.610
Note: Jikeru is a spell to trigger Haido's attack.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.610
Your wind is the best!

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.790
Oooh, erotic!

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.290
Eita, fix that habit.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:44.010
{Part B}

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:57.110
It's because you said
you wanted to go to the rooftop.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:58.860
I'm already broke.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:01.320
Too bad we had to run into Kaneyama.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.070
Kaneyama is on the rooftop?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.950
What am I worrying about...

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.210
If worse comes to worst,
he can just shoot lightning at him.

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:13.750
What happens to him is not my concern.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:21.130
Carrying out the "Ally of Justice" plan!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.550
Gash-kun!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.350
That's enough, Kaneyama-kun.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.890
He's just a little kid.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.520
Don't get in my way, Mizuno.

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.520
Gash-kun, just give up and run away!

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.270
I'm all right.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:38.110
Soon Kiyomaro will come to the rescue.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.030
When Kiyomaro comes,

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.530
he will beat the pants off of you!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.410
Why are you beaten up so badly, Gash?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:53.160
Didn't you shoot any lightning at him?

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:59.800
Do you really think that Takamine
will come to the rescue?

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.260
He'll definitely come!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:05.380
He thinks only of himself,
while everyone else is a nuisance.

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:10.810
Yes, that's right, there's
no use believing in me.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.100
Would you notice already, you idiot.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:17.480
He thinks he's always number one,

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:21.480
and everyone else is just garbage.

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:25.490
That's right, everyone else is just garbage.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:30.660
He also sees you as just
an idiot and annoyance!

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:34.750
That's right, hurry up and realize
that you are being fooled.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.460
And then run away!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:41.130
He doesn't even have one friend!

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:44.170
He can just stay out of
this school forever!

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:50.510
No one wants him to come anyway!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:56.690
That's...

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:58.060
Kiyomaro is...

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:00.820
Kiyomaro is my friend!

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:04.610
What's the use of becoming
friends with him?

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:07.700
Gash-kun, you have to stay still.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.030
He's probably just playing with you.

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:11.080
Shut up!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:13.410
What do you know about Kiyomaro?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.290
It's not like he likes being a genius!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.670
Kiyomaro's father said,

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:21.880
"Even in elementary school,
he played with friends."

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:27.470
"In junior high, his friends started to
become jealous because he became smarter."

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.010
Kiyomaro didn't change!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:32.680
The way his friends saw him changed!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.430
What did Kiyomaro actually do?

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:39.400
What did he do in school today?

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:41.770
Hurt someone else, like you?

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:44.690
Rob money from weaker people, like you?

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:48.400
The one who doesn't need
to come to school is you!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:51.200
Try to insult my friend once more,

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.410
and I, Gash Bell-sama, won't
let you get away so easily.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.830
That's right, Gash-kun is right.

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.790
Then why isn't he coming?

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:04.170
Like hell he's your friend...
That's just a lie.

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:05.590
He'll definitely come!

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.470
Kiyomaro isn't here now because...

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.180
he is taking a crap!

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.390
That must be it!

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:17.850
It's probably fatter than an anaconda,
and the biggest crap ever.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.520
He's crapping, there is no mistake.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:20.900
Crapping, crapping, crapping!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.980
Big crap~, long crap~.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:22.980
Those two...

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.230
Big...

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:26.940
Ah, I feel relieved!

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.110
You're late, Kiyomaro.

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.780
- Did it flow down the drain?
- Did you wash your hands?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.700
Who the hell does that kind of crap?

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:37.870
How's that?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.250
Kiyomaro is here!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.870
The liar is you!

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.250
That's right.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.290
Now that I'm here...

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.500
Someone like you...

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.380
Go Kiyomaro!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:50.380
Kick him!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.970
Don't come over here!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.640
I can't win, can't win...

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.850
I knew this plan was impossible...

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.230
What are you saying?

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:02.940
This plan succeeded ever
since you appeared.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:06.690
The proof is that look
on your face right now.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:10.570
You look more alive than ever before.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:12.950
Alive...?

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:22.210
I also believed that you
would come to the rescue.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.420
Thank you.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:27.920
"Ally of Justice" plan is a success!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:28.960
Yay!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:32.590
What are you getting excited
about, all by yourself?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.680
Are you trying to make
me look like a fool?

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.720
This is bad... He's seriously mad.

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.850
It's all right, Kiyomaro.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.890
I already thought of a new plan,
thinking this might happen.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:42.890
Really?

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.560
I named it the "Praying
to the Heavens" plan.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:51.570
Praying
to the
Heavens
plan

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:49.070
So something from the heavens
will come and save us!

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.860
There's no way that would happen!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.110
It's coming!

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.170
Yay, it's really white!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.540
Hey!

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.250
Who are you?

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.920
How did you get on this rooftop?

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.550
I came with the wind.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:14.840
Oh well, idiots like you probably
don't understand what I said anyway.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.510
Shut up!

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.350
Jikeru!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:24.390
What was that just now?

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:25.980
Wind from his hand?

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:29.570
Hey you!
I decided that you're my girlfriend.

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.320
No, let me go!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:32.860
I'm strong, you know,

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.570
that's why I always get
what I desire by any means.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:37.700
No!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.620
The choral club is starting soon...

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:40.620
Stop it!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:41.990
Let go of Mizuno!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:44.750
The Ally of Justice,
Kiyomaro, is your opponent!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:45.830
Takamine-kun!

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:46.830
Out of my way!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:47.830
Jikeru!

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.130
I knew this was impossible!

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:56.510
If I think about it... There is no way
I can beat someone who beat Kaneyama.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:58.300
Takamine-kun!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.350
Kiyomaro!

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:02.180
The Ally of Justice has
to attack no matter what!

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.680
Gash, it's not possible!

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.190
Gash!

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:07.270
Jikeru!

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:10.730
A kid?

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.360
Didn't I say that I was strong?

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:17.740
Damn...

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.870
The same book as Gash's red book?

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.830
And the one who is
manipulating the wind...

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.330
is a kid who has the same eyes as Gash.

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:28.330
Can it be?

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:32.540
The power of wind is really coming from
that kid using the book and the spell?

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.420
The red book...

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.390
"The first spell... 'Zakeru'."

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:41.050
You gotta be kidding me!

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:44.680
I see!

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.480
This morning I held the book,

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:48.980
Note: "You gotta be kidding me!" is "FuZAKERUna".

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:48.980
and by coincidence I chanted it...

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:52.900
Eita, hurry up and take care of them.

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:56.990
Okay, let's show them our power!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:58.200
Stop it!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.610
Too late!

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:03.370
Take this!
The first spell...

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.200
I beg you, please come out lightning...

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.660
Zakeru!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:12.130
What?

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:26.310
This power is on a different
scale from the one this morning...

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:29.640
What's the matter, Kiyomaro?

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.900
Lightning sure strikes a lot around here.

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:37.480
He doesn't realize that
he shoots lightning?

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:39.950
So the praying to the heavens worked!

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:43.120
Looks like that guy ran away,
thanks to the lightning.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.660
"Ally of Justice" plan is a success!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.490
Yay! Yay!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:50.540
Success!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.340
What was that, Haido?

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:58.880
They had the same book as us.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:01.180
We should retreat for today, Eita.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:02.930
I can't believe it...

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:06.930
That Gash can unleash
such incredible power...

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:14.020
There is no mistake...
That explosion was...

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:18.030
A demon's power.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:20.320
Finally, it has appeared in this city.

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.610
The Demon Master's fight has begun.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.950
Kiyomaro, please give Gash-chan a bath.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:30.200
Why must I?

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:31.210
Kiyomaro!

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:32.870
Note: This is pointless baby talk.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:34.790
You gotta be kidding me...

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.840
Bruises are all over my body and it hurts...

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:42.050
Kiyomaro, tomorrow we'll do the
"Ally of Justice" plan again!

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.680
You're still saying things like that?

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:48.720
I'd feel bad if I don't do
more for your father.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:50.470
Shut up!
Ouch!

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.520
Horns?

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.270
"Dear Old man-dono,"

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:57.860
"Thank you for the birthday present."

00:20:57.860 --> 00:21:03.320
"Somehow thanks to Gash, it looks like
I'll have some unbelievable things waiting..."

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:05.070
{Ending}

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.800
ne konna koto tsuzukete itemo

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.800
You know, even if we continue to progress like this

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:26.050
shiawase wa mitsukaru no kana?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:26.050
Will we be able to find true happiness?

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:31.140
tarinai mono kazoete mitemo

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:31.140
When I try counting what is missing in my life

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:36.270
kiri ga nai no wakatteru you

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:36.270
I know the list will keep going on and on

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:41.940
shinario douri nante

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:41.940
Everything goes according to plans

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:46.700
umaku iku wake nai kara

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:46.700
Of course that can never happen

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.320
toki ni wa zenbu

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.320
At times, everything that I have

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:52.160
nagedashi taku naru

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:52.160
I just want to let it all go

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:57.960
sonna hi ga attemo iiyone

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:57.960
Is it uncommon to have days like this?

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:05.510
hito wa mina okubyou dakara

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:05.510
Everyone is afraid, even though we don't show it

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:10.010
yume wo miru no kana?

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:10.010
Is that why we dream?

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
hito wa mina kodoku dakara

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
Everyone feels lonely on the inside

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.400
ai wo sagasu no kana?

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.400
Is that why we look for love?

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:23.400
kitto chigau

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:23.400
Even though you are not here

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:25.820
basho de kimi mo

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:25.820
know that where ever you are

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:27.990
onaji tsuki wo

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:27.990
You are gazing up

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:31.660
miteru you ne...

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:31.660
at the same moon as me...

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:35.120
{Preview}

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:41.000
Kiyomaro, Suzume-dono is in the TV!

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.210
What?

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:44.500
She got caught again?

00:22:44.500 --> 00:22:47.590
That bank robber has
the same book as me.

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:50.220
Suzume-dono is our friend,
we have to save her!

00:22:50.220 --> 00:22:51.970
It's not something we can do...

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:54.390
Hey, don't lie to yourself!

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:57.310
Next time on Konjiki no Gash Bell:

00:22:57.310 --> 00:22:59.350
Freezing Spell, Gikoru vs Zakeru.

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:02.730
Stop thinking, and run
forth before you think!

00:22:59.690 --> 00:23:03.320
Freezing Spell, Gikoru vs Zakeru
